=== Babylon
--- A Symbol of All Works-Based False Religion
kicker: Application • Genesis 11:4
sub: The Tower, Its Destruction, and the End Times
p: The Tower of Babel is a symbol of all works-based false religion, its destruction a picture of the end times. Just as Babylon the empire, and Nebuchadnezzar and his idol, are a picture of the beast and his abomination. Harlots, taking from God what is His. Leading man to fornication. [[Daniel 3:1-6]]
callout: This spirit of Babylon and its whore of self-righteous works religion, bowing to idols, worshipping the created more than the Creator, is fornication. [[Romans 1:25]]

--- Except It Be for Fornication
kicker: Cross references • Matthew 19:9
sub: The Betrothed Put Away
scripture: Matthew 19:9 | mark: except it be for fornication
p: God’s law says that a betrothed groom can only put away his intended bride for fornication. And that no man may then marry her that has been put away. [[lesson:pulled-israel-put-away|Israel Put Away]]

--- Mystery, Babylon the Great
kicker: Cross references • Revelation 17:5
sub: The Mother of Harlots
scripture: Revelation 17:5
refs: Revelation 18:2-4; Revelation 19:7-8

--- The Spirit of Babylon
center: The spirit of Babylon is fornication, and God’s law of marriage is the context for it, fulfilled in the end times prophecy: the whore of Babylon judged, and the marriage of the Lamb. [[Revelation 19:7]]
